      "id": 158393,
      "name": "pwatson1974",
      "username": "pwatson1974",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-04-15T15:40:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And to continue the collection:</p><p>Captain Cosmic: Your evil-doing days are numbered, no matter how dangerous you are! Have at them, allies!</p><p>Sky-Scraper: It is the time to be fighting! This is a thing I am not bad at. Very much the opposite.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Deadline: It is with great regret that I destroy your civilisation, humans. It is the only way.</p><p>Infinitor: The voices… the voices… cannot hear anything… must silence everything!</p><p>Infinitor, Heroic: I can barely resist the whispers of OblivAeon… You myst help me, heroes!</p><p>Kaargra Warfang: Come and fight for my pleasure! Are you worthy combatants? Find out! For glory!!!</p><p>Progeny: &lt;No comments&gt;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Infinitor vs Captain Cosmic:</p><ul>\n<li>Infinitor: Your face… so familiar… you must be the one the voices want me to end!</li>\n<li>Cosmic: Brother! You know me! We must help you return to your right mind.</li>\n</ul><p>Heroic Infinitor vs Captain Cosmic:</p><ul>\n<li>Infinitor: My brother… I canot do this without you. Help me stop the inevitable!</li>\n<li>Cosmic: You have my hand, Nigel. And the aid of my allies, as well.</li>\n</ul><p>Kaargra vs Sky-Scraper:</p><ul>\n<li>Kaargra: Welcome back, little one. Ready to return to your role as one of the Bloodsworn?</li>\n<li>Sky-Scraper: You are not a friend person. I have new friend persons. We will not be staying a long amount of time.</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I do like the Sky-Scraper ones a lot.</p>",
